---
import "../styles/global.css";
import SiteAnalytics from "../components/SiteAnalytics.astro";
---
<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
<title>Holiday Checkout Return | ReasonableNoise</title>
<meta name="description" content="Return page from the ReasonableNoise holiday shirt test checkout." />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/rn-logo.png" />
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#f9f6ee] text-[#203b2c] antialiased">
<main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-3xl items-center justify-center px-4 py-16">
<section class="w-full rounded-[2rem] border border-[#dedbd0] bg-white p-7 shadow-xl shadow-black/5 sm:p-14">
<a href="/" class="mb-10 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#203b2c] no-underline"><img src="/assets/rn-logo.png" alt="" class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-black object-contain"/>ReasonableNoise</a>
<p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#a63739]">Holiday shop · test checkout</p>
<h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Thanks for exploring the collection.</h1>
<p class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#526b59]">You've returned from the payment provider's checkout page. A browser return alone does not confirm payment or create an order. This seasonal checkout is for isolated testing only until verified payment processing, order records, and fulfillment notifications are approved.</p>
<div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-[#e9e2cf] bg-[#faf7ed] p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-[#566b5b]">For actual purchase confirmation, contact ReasonableNoise with your Stripe receipt. Never rely on a URL parameter as proof of payment.</div>
<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/holiday-shirts" class="rounded-full bg-[#a82b34] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white no-underline">Back to holiday shop</a><a href="/contact" class="rounded-full border border-[#9fada2] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#203b2c] no-underline">Contact us</a></div>
</section>
</main><SiteAnalytics />
</body></html>